      "integrity": "sha512-qWuTmsjNJp4rUxLePZdKXMp9mHs2wLEtMnED+ayd+fgmppYvf9AU2btNW7Nb4oHN6lvcsx+PqK795nFJ3Sgsyg==",
      "shasum": "dd5d0cc8233bd9266c3d2ff97d30ad34bc37455e"
